{"suttaId":"thi-ap17","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[7227,7802],"vripara":"97"},"segments":{"thi-ap17:0.3":"Mahāpajāpatigotamītherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap17:1.1":"“Ekadā lokapajjoto, vesāliyaṃ mahāvane;","thi-ap17:1.3":"Kūṭāgāre susālāyaṃ, vasate narasārathi.","thi-ap17:2.1":"“Tadā jinassa mātucchā, mahāgotami bhikkhunī;","thi-ap17:2.3":"Tahiṃ kate [tahiṃyeva (syā.)] pure ramme, vasī bhikkhunupassaye.","thi-ap17:3.1":"“Bhikkhunīhi vimuttāhi, satehi saha pañcahi;","thi-ap17:3.3":"Rahogatāya tassevaṃ, citassāsi [cittassāpi (syā.)] vitakkitaṃ.","thi-ap17:4.1":"“Buddhassa parinibbānaṃ, sāvakaggayugassa vā;","thi-ap17:4.3":"Rāhulānandanandānaṃ, nāhaṃ lacchāmi passituṃ.","thi-ap17:5.1":"“Buddhassa parinibbānā, sāvakaggayugassa vā;","thi-ap17:5.3":"Mahākassapanandānaṃ, ānandarāhulāna ca.","thi-ap17:6.1":"“Paṭikaccāyusaṅkhāraṃ [paṭigaccāyusaṅkhāre (sī.)], osajjitvāna nibbutiṃ;","thi-ap17:6.3":"Gaccheyyaṃ lokanāthena, anuññātā mahesinā.","thi-ap17:7.1":"“Tathā pañcasatānampi, bhikkhunīnaṃ vitakkitaṃ;","thi-ap17:7.3":"Āsi khemādikānampi, etadeva vitakkitaṃ.","thi-ap17:8.1":"“Bhūmicālo tadā āsi, nāditā devadundubhī;","thi-ap17:8.3":"Upassayādhivatthāyo, devatā sokapīḷitā.","thi-ap17:9.1":"“Vilapantā sukaruṇaṃ [sakaruṇaṃ (sī. syā. pī.)], tatthassūni pavattayuṃ;","thi-ap17:9.3":"Mittā [sabbā (syā. pī.)] bhikkhuniyo tāhi, upagantvāna gotamiṃ.","thi-ap17:10.1":"“Nipacca sirasā pāde, idaṃ vacanamabravuṃ;","thi-ap17:10.3":"‘Tattha toyalavāsittā, mayamayye rahogatā.","thi-ap17:11.1":"“‘Sā calā calitā bhūmi, nāditā devadundubhī;","thi-ap17:11.3":"Paridevā ca suyyante, kimatthaṃ nūna gotamī’.","thi-ap17:12.1":"“Tadā avoca sā sabbaṃ, yathāparivitakkitaṃ;","thi-ap17:12.3":"Tāyopi sabbā āhaṃsu, yathāparivitakkitaṃ.","thi-ap17:13.1":"“‘Yadi te rucitaṃ ayye, nibbānaṃ paramaṃ sivaṃ;","thi-ap17:13.3":"Nibbāyissāma sabbāpi, buddhānuññāya subbate.","thi-ap17:14.1":"“‘Mayaṃ sahāva nikkhantā, gharāpi ca bhavāpi ca;","thi-ap17:14.3":"Sahāyeva gamissāma, nibbānaṃ padamuttamaṃ’.","thi-ap17:15.1":"“‘Nibbānāya vajantīnaṃ, kiṃ vakkhāmī’ti sā vadaṃ;","thi-ap17:15.3":"Saha sabbāhi niggañchi, bhikkhunīnilayā tadā.","thi-ap17:16.1":"“Upassaye yādhivatthā, devatā tā khamantu me;","thi-ap17:16.3":"Bhikkhunīnilayassedaṃ, pacchimaṃ dassanaṃ mama.","thi-ap17:17.1":"“Na jarā maccu vā yattha, appiyehi samāgamo;","thi-ap17:17.3":"Piyehi na viyogotthi, taṃ vajissaṃ [taṃ vajjiyaṃ (syā.)] asaṅkhataṃ.","thi-ap17:18.1":"“Avītarāgā taṃ sutvā, vacanaṃ sugatorasā;","thi-ap17:18.3":"Sokaṭṭā parideviṃsu, aho no appapuññatā.","thi-ap17:19.1":"“Bhikkhunīnilayo suñño, bhūto tāhi vinā ayaṃ;","thi-ap17:19.3":"Pabhāte viya tārāyo, na dissanti jinorasā.","thi-ap17:20.1":"“Nibbānaṃ gotamī yāti, satehi saha pañcahi;","thi-ap17:20.3":"Nadīsatehiva saha, gaṅgā pañcahi sāgaraṃ.","thi-ap17:21.1":"“Rathiyāya vajantiyo [vajantiṃ taṃ (sī.), vajanti taṃ (syā.), vajantānaṃ (pī.)], disvā saddhā upāsikā;","thi-ap17:21.3":"Gharā nikkhamma pādesu, nipacca idamabravuṃ.","thi-ap17:22.1":"“‘Pasīdassu mahābhoge, anāthāyo vihāya no;","thi-ap17:22.3":"Tayā na yuttā [yuttaṃ (sī. syā. pī.)] nibbātuṃ, icchaṭṭā vilapiṃsu tā’.","thi-ap17:23.1":"“Tāsaṃ sokapahānatthaṃ, avoca madhuraṃ giraṃ;","thi-ap17:23.3":"‘Ruditena alaṃ puttā, hāsakāloyamajja vo.","thi-ap17:24.1":"“‘Pariññātaṃ mayā dukkhaṃ, dukkhahetu vivajjito;","thi-ap17:24.3":"Nirodho me sacchikato, maggo cāpi subhāvito.","thi-ap17:25.1":"Paṭhamaṃ bhāṇavāraṃ.","thi-ap17:26.1":"“‘Pariciṇṇo mayā satthā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ;","thi-ap17:26.3":"Ohito garuko bhāro, bhavanetti samūhatā.","thi-ap17:27.1":"“‘Yassatthāya pabbajitā, agārasmānagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap17:27.3":"So me attho anuppatto, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayo.","thi-ap17:28.1":"“‘Buddho tassa ca saddhammo, anūno yāva tiṭṭhati;","thi-ap17:28.3":"Nibbātuṃ tāva kālo me, mā maṃ socatha puttikā.","thi-ap17:29.1":"“‘Koṇḍaññānandanandādī, tiṭṭhanti rāhulo jino;","thi-ap17:29.3":"Sukhito sahito saṅgho, hatadabbā ca titthiyā.","thi-ap17:30.1":"“‘Okkākavaṃsassa yaso, ussito māramaddano;","thi-ap17:30.3":"Nanu sampati kālo me, nibbānatthāya puttikā.","thi-ap17:31.1":"“‘Cirappabhuti yaṃ mayhaṃ, patthitaṃ ajja sijjhate;","thi-ap17:31.3":"Ānandabherikāloyaṃ, kiṃ vo assūhi puttikā.","thi-ap17:32.1":"“‘Sace mayi dayā atthi, yadi catthi kataññutā;","thi-ap17:32.3":"Saddhammaṭṭhitiyā sabbā, karotha vīriyaṃ daḷhaṃ.","thi-ap17:33.1":"“‘Thīnaṃ adāsi pabbajjaṃ, sambuddho yācito mayā;","thi-ap17:33.3":"Tasmā yathāhaṃ nandissaṃ, tathā tamanutiṭṭhatha’.","thi-ap17:34.1":"“Tā evamanusāsitvā, bhikkhunīhi purakkhatā;","thi-ap17:34.3":"Upecca buddhaṃ vanditvā, idaṃ vacanamabravi.","thi-ap17:35.1":"“‘Ahaṃ sugata te mātā, tvañca vīra pitā mama;","thi-ap17:35.3":"Saddhammasukhada [saddhammasukhado (sī. syā. pī.)] nātha, tayā jātāmhi gotama.","thi-ap17:36.1":"“‘Saṃvaddhitoyaṃ sugata, rūpakāyo mayā tava;","thi-ap17:36.3":"Anindito [ānandiyo (syā.), anindiyo (pī.)] dhammakāyo [dhammatanu (sī. pī. ka.)], mama saṃvaddhito tayā.","thi-ap17:37.1":"“‘Muhuttaṃ taṇhāsamaṇaṃ, khīraṃ tvaṃ pāyito mayā;","thi-ap17:37.3":"Tayāhaṃ santamaccantaṃ, dhammakhīrañhi [dhammakhīrampi (syā., ka.)] pāyitā.","thi-ap17:38.1":"“‘Bandhanārakkhane mayhaṃ, aṇaṇo [anaṇo (sī. syā. pī.)] tvaṃ mahāmune;","thi-ap17:38.3":"Puttakāmā thiyo yācaṃ, labhanti tādisaṃ sutaṃ.","thi-ap17:39.1":"“‘Mandhātādinarindānaṃ, yā mātā sā bhavaṇṇave;","thi-ap17:39.3":"Nimuggāhaṃ tayā putta, tāritā bhavasāgarā.","thi-ap17:40.1":"“‘Rañño mātā mahesīti, sulabhaṃ nāmamitthinaṃ;","thi-ap17:40.3":"Buddhamātāti yaṃ nāmaṃ, etaṃ paramadullabhaṃ.","thi-ap17:41.1":"“‘Tañca laddhaṃ mahāvīra, paṇidhānaṃ mamaṃ tayā;","thi-ap17:41.3":"Aṇukaṃ vā mahantaṃ vā, taṃ sabbaṃ pūritaṃ mayā.","thi-ap17:42.1":"“‘Parinibbātumicchāmi, vihāyemaṃ kaḷevaraṃ;","thi-ap17:42.3":"Anujānāhi me vīra, dukkhantakara nāyaka.","thi-ap17:43.1":"“‘Cakkaṅkusadhajākiṇṇe, pāde kamalakomale;","thi-ap17:43.3":"Pasārehi paṇāmaṃ te, karissaṃ puttauttame [puttapemasā (sī. pī.), puttapemahaṃ (syā.)].","thi-ap17:44.1":"“‘Suvaṇṇarāsisaṅkāsaṃ, sarīraṃ kuru pākaṭaṃ;","thi-ap17:44.3":"Katvā dehaṃ sudiṭṭhaṃ te, santiṃ gacchāmi nāyaka’.","thi-ap17:45.1":"“Dvattiṃsalakkhaṇūpetaṃ, suppabhālaṅkataṃ tanuṃ;","thi-ap17:45.3":"Sañjhāghanāva bālakkaṃ, mātucchaṃ dassayī jino.","thi-ap17:46.1":"“Phullāravindasaṃkāse, taruṇādiccasappabhe;","thi-ap17:46.3":"Cakkaṅkite pādatale, tato sā sirasā pati.","thi-ap17:47.1":"“‘Paṇamāmi narādicca, ādiccakulaketukaṃ;","thi-ap17:47.3":"Pacchime maraṇe mayhaṃ [saraṇaṃ mayhaṃ (syā.)], na taṃ ikkhāmahaṃ puno.","thi-ap17:48.1":"“‘Itthiyo nāma lokagga, sabbadosākarā matā;","thi-ap17:48.3":"Yadi ko catthi doso me, khamassu karuṇākara.","thi-ap17:49.1":"“‘Itthikānañca pabbajjaṃ, haṃ taṃ yāciṃ punappunaṃ;","thi-ap17:49.3":"Tattha ce atthi doso me, taṃ khamassu narāsabha.","thi-ap17:50.1":"“‘Mayā bhikkhuniyo vīra, tavānuññāya sāsitā;","thi-ap17:50.3":"Tatra ce atthi dunnītaṃ, taṃ khamassu khamādhipa [khamādhiti (syā.), khamāpito (ka.)].","thi-ap17:51.1":"“‘Akkhante nāma khantabbaṃ, kiṃ bhave guṇabhūsane;","thi-ap17:51.3":"Kimuttaraṃ te vakkhāmi, nibbānāya vajantiyā.","thi-ap17:52.1":"“‘Suddhe anūne mama bhikkhusaṅghe, lokā ito nissarituṃ khamante;","thi-ap17:52.3":"Pabhātakāle byasanaṅgatānaṃ, disvāna niyyātiva candalekhā’.","thi-ap17:53.1":"“‘Tadetarā bhikkhuniyo jinaggaṃ, tārāva candānugatā sumeruṃ;","thi-ap17:53.3":"Padakkhiṇaṃ kacca nipacca pāde, ṭhitā mukhantaṃ samudikkhamānā.","thi-ap17:54.1":"“‘Na tittipubbaṃ tava dassanena, cakkhuṃ na sotaṃ tava bhāsitena;","thi-ap17:54.3":"Cittaṃ mamaṃ kevalamekameva, pappuyya taṃ dhammarasena titti.","thi-ap17:55.1":"“‘Nadato parisāyaṃ te, vāditabbapahārino;","thi-ap17:55.3":"Ye te dakkhanti vadanaṃ, dhaññā te narapuṅgava.","thi-ap17:56.1":"“‘Dīghaṅgulī tambanakhe, subhe āyatapaṇhike;","thi-ap17:56.3":"Ye pāde paṇamissanti [paṇamāyanti (syā.)], tepi dhaññā guṇandhara.","thi-ap17:57.1":"“‘Madhurāni pahaṭṭhāni, dosagghāni hitāni ca;","thi-ap17:57.3":"Ye te vākyāni suyyanti, tepi dhaññā naruttama.","thi-ap17:58.1":"“‘Dhaññāhaṃ te mahāvīra, pādapūjanatapparā [mānapūjanatapparā (ka.)];","thi-ap17:58.3":"Tiṇṇasaṃsārakantārā, suvākyena sirīmato’.","thi-ap17:59.1":"“Tato sā anusāvetvā [anumāne tvā (ka.)], bhikkhusaṅghampi subbatā;","thi-ap17:59.3":"Rāhulānandanande ca, vanditvā idamabravi.","thi-ap17:60.1":"“‘Āsīvisālayasame, rogāvāse kaḷevare;","thi-ap17:60.3":"Nibbindā dukkhasaṅghāṭe, jarāmaraṇagocare.","thi-ap17:61.1":"“‘Nānākalimalākiṇṇe [nānākuṇapamalākiṇṇe (syā.), nānākāḷamalākiṇṇe (ka.)], parāyatte nirīhake;","thi-ap17:61.3":"Tena nibbātumicchāmi, anumaññatha puttakā’.","thi-ap17:62.1":"“Nando rāhulabhaddo ca, vītasokā nirāsavā;","thi-ap17:62.3":"Ṭhitācalaṭṭhiti thirā, dhammatamanucintayuṃ.","thi-ap17:63.1":"“‘Dhiratthu saṅkhataṃ lolaṃ, asāraṃ kadalūpamaṃ;","thi-ap17:63.3":"Māyāmarīcisadisaṃ, itaraṃ anavaṭṭhitaṃ.","thi-ap17:64.1":"“‘Yattha nāma jinassāyaṃ, mātucchā buddhaposikā;","thi-ap17:64.3":"Gotamī nidhanaṃ yāti, aniccaṃ sabbasaṅkhataṃ’.","thi-ap17:65.1":"“Ānando ca tadā sekho, sokaṭṭo [kaniṭṭho (syā.)] jinavacchalo;","thi-ap17:65.3":"Tatthassūni karonto so, karuṇaṃ paridevati.","thi-ap17:66.1":"“Hā santiṃ [bhāsantī (syā.)] gotamī yāti, nūna buddhopi nibbutiṃ;","thi-ap17:66.3":"Gacchati na cireneva, aggiriva nirindhano.","thi-ap17:67.1":"“Evaṃ vilāpamānaṃ taṃ, ānandaṃ āha gotamī;","thi-ap17:67.3":"Sutasāgaragambhīra, buddhopaṭṭhānatappara.","thi-ap17:68.1":"“‘Na yuttaṃ socituṃ putta, hāsakāle upaṭṭhite;","thi-ap17:68.3":"Tayā me saraṇaṃ putta, nibbānaṃ tamupāgataṃ.","thi-ap17:69.1":"“‘Tayā tāta samajjhiṭṭho, pabbajjaṃ anujāni no;","thi-ap17:69.3":"Mā putta vimano hohi, saphalo te parissamo.","thi-ap17:70.1":"“‘Yaṃ na diṭṭhaṃ purāṇehi, titthikācariyehipi;","thi-ap17:70.3":"Taṃ padaṃ sukumārīhi, sattavassāhi veditaṃ.","thi-ap17:71.1":"“‘Buddhasāsanapāleta, pacchimaṃ dassanaṃ tava;","thi-ap17:71.3":"Tattha gacchāmahaṃ putta, gato yattha na dissate.","thi-ap17:72.1":"“‘Kadāci dhammaṃ desento, khipī lokagganāyako;","thi-ap17:72.3":"Tadāhaṃ āsīsavācaṃ, avocaṃ anukampikā.","thi-ap17:73.1":"“‘Ciraṃ jīva mahāvīra, kappaṃ tiṭṭha mahāmune;","thi-ap17:73.3":"Sabbalokassa atthāya, bhavassu ajarāmaro.","thi-ap17:74.1":"“‘Taṃ tathāvādiniṃ buddho, mamaṃ so etadabravi;","thi-ap17:74.3":"‘Na hevaṃ vandiyā buddhā, yathā vandasi gotamī.","thi-ap17:75.1":"“‘Kathaṃ carahi sabbaññū, vanditabbā tathāgatā;","thi-ap17:75.3":"Kathaṃ avandiyā buddhā, taṃ me akkhāhi pucchito.","thi-ap17:76.1":"“‘Āraddhavīriye pahitatte, niccaṃ daḷhaparakkame;","thi-ap17:76.3":"Samagge sāvake passa, etaṃ buddhānavandanaṃ.","thi-ap17:77.1":"“‘Tato upassayaṃ gantvā, ekikāhaṃ vicintayiṃ;","thi-ap17:77.3":"Samaggaparisaṃ nātho, rodhesi tibhavantago.","thi-ap17:78.1":"“‘Handāhaṃ parinibbissaṃ, mā vipattitamaddasaṃ;","thi-ap17:78.3":"Evāhaṃ cintayitvāna, disvāna isisattamaṃ.","thi-ap17:79.1":"“‘Parinibbānakālaṃ me, ārocesiṃ [ārocemi (syā.)] vināyakaṃ;","thi-ap17:79.3":"Tato so samanuññāsi, kālaṃ jānāhi gotamī.","thi-ap17:80.1":"“‘Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap17:81.1":"“‘Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap17:82.1":"“‘Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap17:83.1":"“‘Thīnaṃ dhammābhisamaye, ye bālā vimatiṃ gatā;","thi-ap17:83.3":"Tesaṃ diṭṭhippahānatthaṃ, iddhiṃ dassehi gotamī’.","thi-ap17:84.1":"“Tadā nipacca sambuddhaṃ, uppatitvāna ambaraṃ;","thi-ap17:84.3":"Iddhī anekā dassesi, buddhānuññāya gotamī.","thi-ap17:85.1":"“Ekikā bahudhā āsi, bahukā cetikā tathā;","thi-ap17:85.3":"Āvibhāvaṃ tirobhāvaṃ, tirokuṭṭaṃ [tirokuḍḍaṃ (syā.)] tironagaṃ.","thi-ap17:86.1":"“Asajjamānā agamā, bhūmiyampi nimujjatha;","thi-ap17:86.3":"Abhijjamāne udake, agañchi mahiyā yathā.","thi-ap17:87.1":"“Sakuṇīva tathākāse, pallaṅkena kamī tadā;","thi-ap17:87.3":"Vasaṃ vattesi kāyena, yāva brahmanivesanaṃ.","thi-ap17:88.1":"“Sineruṃ daṇḍaṃ katvāna, chattaṃ katvā mahāmahiṃ;","thi-ap17:88.3":"Samūlaṃ parivattetvā, dhārayaṃ caṅkamī nabhe.","thi-ap17:89.1":"“Chassūrodayakāleva, lokañcākāsi dhūmikaṃ;","thi-ap17:89.3":"Yugante viya lokaṃ sā, jālāmālākulaṃ akā.","thi-ap17:90.1":"“Mucalindaṃ mahāselaṃ, merumūlanadantare [merumandāradaddare (sī. pī.), meruṃ mandāradantare (syā.)];","thi-ap17:90.3":"Sāsapāriva sabbāni, ekenaggahi muṭṭhinā.","thi-ap17:91.1":"“Aṅgulaggena chādesi, bhākaraṃ sanisākaraṃ;","thi-ap17:91.3":"Candasūrasahassāni, āveḷamiva dhārayi.","thi-ap17:92.1":"“Catusāgaratoyāni, dhārayī ekapāṇinā;","thi-ap17:92.3":"Yugantajaladākāraṃ, mahāvassaṃ pavassatha.","thi-ap17:93.1":"“Cakkavattiṃ saparisaṃ, māpayī sā nabhattale;","thi-ap17:93.3":"Garuḷaṃ dviradaṃ sīhaṃ, vinadantaṃ padassayi.","thi-ap17:94.1":"“Ekikā abhinimmitvā, appameyyaṃ bhikkhunīgaṇaṃ;","thi-ap17:94.3":"Puna antaradhāpetvā, ekikā munimabravi.","thi-ap17:95.1":"“‘Mātucchā te mahāvīra, tava sāsanakārikā;","thi-ap17:95.3":"Anuppattā sakaṃ atthaṃ, pāde vandāmi cakkhuma’.","thi-ap17:96.1":"“Dassetvā vividhā iddhī, orohitvā nabhattalā;","thi-ap17:96.3":"Vanditvā lokapajjotaṃ, ekamantaṃ nisīdi sā.","thi-ap17:97.1":"“Sā vīsavassasatikā, jātiyāhaṃ mahāmune;","thi-ap17:97.3":"Alamettāvatā vīra, nibbāyissāmi nāyaka.","thi-ap17:98.1":"“Tadātivimhitā sabbā, parisā sā katañjalī;","thi-ap17:98.3":"Avocayye kathaṃ āsi, atuliddhiparakkamā.","thi-ap17:99.1":"“Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabbadhammesu cakkhumā;","thi-ap17:99.3":"Ito satasahassamhi, kappe uppajji nāyako.","thi-ap17:100.1":"“Tadāhaṃ haṃsavatiyaṃ, jātāmaccakule ahuṃ;","thi-ap17:100.3":"Sabbopakārasampanne, iddhe phīte mahaddhane.","thi-ap17:101.1":"“Kadāci pitunā saddhiṃ, dāsigaṇapurakkhatā;","thi-ap17:101.3":"Mahatā parivārena, taṃ upecca narāsabhaṃ.","thi-ap17:102.1":"“Vāsavaṃ viya vassantaṃ, dhammameghaṃ anāsavaṃ [pavassayaṃ (ka.)];","thi-ap17:102.3":"Saradādiccasadisaṃ, raṃsijālasamujjalaṃ [raṃsimālākulaṃ jinaṃ (sī. syā.), raṃsijālākulaṃ jinaṃ (pī.)].","thi-ap17:103.1":"“Disvā cittaṃ pasādetvā, sutvā cassa subhāsitaṃ;","thi-ap17:103.3":"Mātucchaṃ bhikkhuniṃ agge, ṭhapentaṃ naranāyakaṃ.","thi-ap17:104.1":"“Sutvā datvā mahādānaṃ, sattāhaṃ tassa tādino;","thi-ap17:104.3":"Sasaṅghassa naraggassa, paccayāni bahūni ca.","thi-ap17:105.1":"“Nipacca pādamūlamhi, taṃ ṭhānamabhipatthayiṃ;","thi-ap17:105.3":"Tato mahāparisatiṃ, avoca isisattamo.","thi-ap17:106.1":"“‘Yā sasaṅghaṃ abhojesi, sattāhaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","thi-ap17:106.3":"Tamahaṃ kittayissāmi, suṇātha mama bhāsato.","thi-ap17:107.1":"“‘Satasahassito kappe, okkākakulasambhavo;","thi-ap17:107.3":"Gotamo nāma gottena, satthā loke bhavissati.","thi-ap17:108.1":"“‘Tassa dhammesu dāyādā, orasā dhammanimmitā;","thi-ap17:108.3":"Gotamī nāma nāmena, hessati satthu sāvikā.","thi-ap17:109.1":"“‘Tassa buddhassa mātucchā, jīvitāpādikā [jīvitapālikā (syā.)] ayaṃ;","thi-ap17:109.3":"Rattaññūnañca aggattaṃ, bhikkhunīnaṃ labhissati’.","thi-ap17:110.1":"“Taṃ sutvāna pamoditvā [taṃ sutvāhaṃ pamuditā (sī. syā. pī.)], yāvajīvaṃ tadā jinaṃ;","thi-ap17:110.3":"Paccayehi upaṭṭhitvā, tato kālaṅkatā ahaṃ.","thi-ap17:111.1":"“Tāvatiṃsesu devesu, sabbakāmasamiddhisu;","thi-ap17:111.3":"Nibbattā dasahaṅgehi, aññe abhibhaviṃ ahaṃ.","thi-ap17:112.1":"“Rūpasaddehi gandhehi, rasehi phusanehi ca;","thi-ap17:112.3":"Āyunāpi ca vaṇṇena, sukhena yasasāpi ca.","thi-ap17:113.1":"“Tathevādhipateyyena, adhigayha virocahaṃ;","thi-ap17:113.3":"Ahosiṃ amarindassa, mahesī dayitā tahiṃ.","thi-ap17:114.1":"“Saṃsāre saṃsarantīhaṃ, kammavāyusameritā;","thi-ap17:114.3":"Kāsissa rañño visaye, ajāyiṃ dāsagāmake.","thi-ap17:115.1":"“Pañcadāsasatānūnā, nivasanti tahiṃ tadā;","thi-ap17:115.3":"Sabbesaṃ tattha yo jeṭṭho, tassa jāyā ahosahaṃ.","thi-ap17:116.1":"“Sayambhuno pañcasatā, gāmaṃ piṇḍāya pāvisuṃ;","thi-ap17:116.3":"Te disvāna ahaṃ tuṭṭhā, saha sabbāhi itthibhi [ñātibhi (sī. syā. pī.)].","thi-ap17:117.1":"“Pūgā hutvāva sabbāyo [katvā pañcasatakuṭī (sī. syā.)], catumāse upaṭṭhahuṃ [upaṭṭhiya (sī. syā. pī.)];","thi-ap17:117.3":"Ticīvarāni datvāna, saṃsarimha [pasannāmha (syā.)] sasāmikā.","thi-ap17:118.1":"“Tato cutā sabbāpi tā, tāvatiṃsagatā mayaṃ;","thi-ap17:118.3":"Pacchime ca bhave dāni, jātā devadahe pure.","thi-ap17:119.1":"“Pitā añjanasakko me, mātā mama sulakkhaṇā;","thi-ap17:119.3":"Tato kapilavatthusmiṃ, suddhodanagharaṃ gatā.","thi-ap17:120.1":"“Sesā [sabbā (syā.)] sakyakule jātā, sakyānaṃ gharamāgamuṃ;","thi-ap17:120.3":"Ahaṃ visiṭṭhā sabbāsaṃ, jinassāpādikā ahuṃ.","thi-ap17:121.1":"“Mama puttobhinikkhamma [sa me putto …(syā.)], buddho āsi vināyako;","thi-ap17:121.3":"Pacchāhaṃ pabbajitvāna, satehi saha pañcahi.","thi-ap17:122.1":"“Sākiyānīhi dhīrāhi, saha santisukhaṃ phusiṃ;","thi-ap17:122.3":"Ye tadā pubbajātiyaṃ, amhākaṃ āsu sāmino.","thi-ap17:123.1":"“Sahapuññassa kattāro, mahāsamayakārakā;","thi-ap17:123.3":"Phusiṃsu arahattaṃ te, sugatenānukampitā.","thi-ap17:124.1":"“Tadetarā bhikkhuniyo, āruhiṃsu nabhattalaṃ;","thi-ap17:124.3":"Saṃgatā [khagatā (sī.)] viya tārāyo, virociṃsu mahiddhikā.","thi-ap17:125.1":"“Iddhī anekā dassesuṃ, piḷandhavikatiṃ yathā;","thi-ap17:125.3":"Kammāro kanakasseva, kammaññassa susikkhito [puṇṇakammesu sikkhitā (syā.)].","thi-ap17:126.1":"“Dassetvā pāṭihīrāni, vicittāni [vividhāni (syā.)] bahūni ca;","thi-ap17:126.3":"Tosetvā vādipavaraṃ, muniṃ saparisaṃ tadā.","thi-ap17:127.1":"“Orohitvāna gaganā, vanditvā isisattamaṃ;","thi-ap17:127.3":"Anuññātā naraggena, yathāṭhāne nisīdisuṃ.","thi-ap17:128.1":"“‘Ahonukampikā amhaṃ, sabbāsaṃ cira gotamī;","thi-ap17:128.3":"Vāsitā tava puññehi, pattā no āsavakkhayaṃ.","thi-ap17:129.1":"“‘Kilesā jhāpitā amhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","thi-ap17:129.3":"Nāgīva bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāma anāsavā.","thi-ap17:130.1":"“‘Svāgataṃ vata no āsi, buddhaseṭṭhassa santike;","thi-ap17:130.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap17:131.1":"“‘Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","thi-ap17:131.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap17:132.1":"“‘Iddhīsu ca vasī homa, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap17:132.3":"Cetopariyañāṇassa, vasī homa mahāmune.","thi-ap17:133.1":"“‘Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāma, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap17:133.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap17:134.1":"“‘Atthe dhamme ca nerutte, paṭibhāne [paṭibhāṇe (sī. syā.)] ca vijjati;","thi-ap17:134.3":"Ñāṇaṃ amhaṃ mahāvīra, uppannaṃ tava santike.","thi-ap17:135.1":"“‘Asmābhi pariciṇṇosi, mettacittāhi nāyaka;","thi-ap17:135.3":"Anujānāhi sabbāsaṃ [sabbāyo (syā. pī.)], nibbānāya mahāmune’.","thi-ap17:136.1":"“Nibbāyissāma iccevaṃ, kiṃ vakkhāmi vadantiyo;","thi-ap17:136.3":"Yassa dāni ca vo kālaṃ, maññathāti jinobravi.","thi-ap17:137.1":"“Gotamīādikā tāyo, tadā bhikkhuniyo jinaṃ;","thi-ap17:137.3":"Vanditvā āsanā tamhā, vuṭṭhāya agamiṃsu tā.","thi-ap17:138.1":"“Mahatā janakāyena, saha lokagganāyako;","thi-ap17:138.3":"Anusaṃyāyī so [anusaṃsāvayī (syā. ka.)] vīro, mātucchaṃ yāvakoṭṭhakaṃ.","thi-ap17:139.1":"“Tadā nipati pādesu, gotamī lokabandhuno;","thi-ap17:139.3":"Saheva tāhi sabbāhi, pacchimaṃ pādavandanaṃ.","thi-ap17:140.1":"“‘Idaṃ pacchimakaṃ mayhaṃ, lokanāthassa dassanaṃ;","thi-ap17:140.3":"Na puno amatākāraṃ, passissāmi mukhaṃ tava.","thi-ap17:141.1":"“‘Na ca me vandanaṃ [vadanaṃ (ka.)] vīra, tava pāde sukomale;","thi-ap17:141.3":"Samphusissati lokagga, ajja gacchāmi nibbutiṃ’.","thi-ap17:142.1":"“Rūpena kiṃ tavānena, diṭṭhe dhamme yathātathe;","thi-ap17:142.3":"Sabbaṃ saṅkhatamevetaṃ, anassāsikamittaraṃ.","thi-ap17:143.1":"“Sā saha tāhi gantvāna, bhikkhunupassayaṃ sakaṃ;","thi-ap17:143.3":"Aḍḍhapallaṅkamābhujja, nisīdi paramāsane.","thi-ap17:144.1":"“Tadā upāsikā tattha, buddhasāsanavacchalā;","thi-ap17:144.3":"Tassā pavattiṃ sutvāna, upesuṃ pādavandikā.","thi-ap17:145.1":"“Karehi uraṃ pahantā, chinnamūlā yathā latā;","thi-ap17:145.3":"Rodantā karuṇaṃ ravaṃ, sokaṭṭā bhūmipātitā.","thi-ap17:146.1":"“Mā no saraṇade nāthe, vihāya gami nibbutiṃ;","thi-ap17:146.3":"Nipatitvāna yācāma, sabbāyo sirasā mayaṃ.","thi-ap17:147.1":"“Yā padhānatamā tāsaṃ, saddhā paññā upāsikā;","thi-ap17:147.3":"Tassā sīsaṃ pamajjantī, idaṃ vacanamabravi.","thi-ap17:148.1":"“‘Alaṃ puttā visādena, mārapāsānuvattinā;","thi-ap17:148.3":"Aniccaṃ saṅkhataṃ sabbaṃ, viyogantaṃ calācalaṃ’.","thi-ap17:149.1":"“Tato sā tā visajjitvā, paṭhamaṃ jhānamuttamaṃ;","thi-ap17:149.3":"Dutiyañca tatiyañca, samāpajji catutthakaṃ.","thi-ap17:150.1":"“Ākāsāyatanañceva, viññāṇāyatanaṃ tathā;","thi-ap17:150.3":"Ākiñcaṃ nevasaññañca, samāpajji yathākkamaṃ.","thi-ap17:151.1":"“Paṭilomena jhānāni, samāpajjittha gotamī;","thi-ap17:151.3":"Yāvatā paṭhamaṃ jhānaṃ, tato yāvacatutthakaṃ.","thi-ap17:152.1":"“Tato vuṭṭhāya nibbāyi, dīpaccīva nirāsavā [nirāsanā (sī. pī.)];","thi-ap17:152.3":"Bhūmicālo mahā āsi, nabhasā vijjutā pati.","thi-ap17:153.1":"“Panāditā dundubhiyo, parideviṃsu devatā;","thi-ap17:153.3":"Pupphavuṭṭhī ca gaganā, abhivassatha medaniṃ.","thi-ap17:154.1":"“Kampito merurājāpi, raṅgamajjhe yathā naṭo;","thi-ap17:154.3":"Sokena cātidīnova viravo āsi sāgaro.","thi-ap17:155.1":"“Devā nāgāsurā brahmā, saṃviggāhiṃsu taṅkhaṇe;","thi-ap17:155.3":"‘Aniccā vata saṅkhārā, yathāyaṃ vilayaṃ gatā’.","thi-ap17:156.1":"“Yā ce maṃ parivāriṃsu, satthu sāsanakārikā;","thi-ap17:156.3":"Tāyopi anupādānā, dīpacci viya [dīpasikhā viya (syā.)] nibbutā.","thi-ap17:157.1":"“Hā yogā vippayogantā, hāniccaṃ sabbasaṅkhataṃ;","thi-ap17:157.3":"Hā jīvitaṃ vināsantaṃ, iccāsi paridevanā.","thi-ap17:158.1":"“Tato devā ca brahmā ca, lokadhammānuvattanaṃ;","thi-ap17:158.3":"Kālānurūpaṃ kubbanti, upetvā isisattamaṃ.","thi-ap17:159.1":"“Tadā āmantayī satthā, ānandaṃ sutasāgaraṃ [sutisāgaraṃ (sī. syā. pī.)];","thi-ap17:159.3":"‘Gacchānanda nivedehi, bhikkhūnaṃ mātu nibbutiṃ’.","thi-ap17:160.1":"“Tadānando nirānando, assunā puṇṇalocano;","thi-ap17:160.3":"Gaggarena sarenāha,‘samāgacchantu bhikkhavo.","thi-ap17:161.1":"“‘Pubbadakkhiṇapacchāsu, uttarāya ca santike;","thi-ap17:161.3":"Suṇantu bhāsitaṃ mayhaṃ, bhikkhavo sugatorasā.","thi-ap17:162.1":"“‘Yā vaḍḍhayi payattena, sarīraṃ pacchimaṃ mune;","thi-ap17:162.3":"Sā gotamī gatā santiṃ, tārāva sūriyodaye.","thi-ap17:163.1":"“‘Buddhamātāti paññattiṃ [saññattiṃ (syā.)], ṭhapayitvā gatāsamaṃ;","thi-ap17:163.3":"Na yattha pañcanettopi, gatiṃ [gataṃ (sī. pī.), tattha (syā.)] dakkhati nāyako.","thi-ap17:164.1":"“‘Yassatthi sugate saddhā, yo ca piyo mahāmune;","thi-ap17:164.3":"Buddhamātussa [buddhamātari (sī.), buddhassa mātu (syā.)] sakkāraṃ, karotu sugatoraso’.","thi-ap17:165.1":"“Sudūraṭṭhāpi taṃ sutvā, sīghamāgacchu bhikkhavo;","thi-ap17:165.3":"Keci buddhānubhāvena, keci iddhīsu kovidā.","thi-ap17:166.1":"“Kūṭāgāravare ramme, sabbasoṇṇamaye subhe;","thi-ap17:166.3":"Mañcakaṃ samāropesuṃ, yattha suttāsi gotamī.","thi-ap17:167.1":"“Cattāro lokapālā te, aṃsehi samadhārayuṃ;","thi-ap17:167.3":"Sesā sakkādikā devā, kūṭāgāre samaggahuṃ.","thi-ap17:168.1":"“Kūṭāgārāni sabbāni, āsuṃ pañcasatānipi;","thi-ap17:168.3":"Saradādiccavaṇṇāni, vissakammakatāni hi.","thi-ap17:169.1":"“Sabbā tāpi bhikkhuniyo, āsuṃ mañcesu sāyitā;","thi-ap17:169.3":"Devānaṃ khandhamāruḷhā, niyyanti anupubbaso.","thi-ap17:170.1":"“Sabbaso chāditaṃ āsi, vitānena nabhattalaṃ;","thi-ap17:170.3":"Satārā candasūrā ca, lañchitā kanakāmayā.","thi-ap17:171.1":"“Paṭākā ussitānekā, vitatā pupphakañcukā;","thi-ap17:171.3":"Ogatākāsapadumā [ogatākāsadhūmāva (pī.)], mahiyā pupphamuggataṃ.","thi-ap17:172.1":"“Dassanti candasūriyā, pajjalanti ca tārakā;","thi-ap17:172.3":"Majjhaṃ gatopi cādicco, na tāpesi sasī yathā.","thi-ap17:173.1":"“Devā dibbehi gandhehi, mālehi surabhīhi ca;","thi-ap17:173.3":"Vāditehi ca naccehi, saṅgītīhi ca pūjayuṃ.","thi-ap17:174.1":"“Nāgāsurā ca brahmāno, yathāsatti yathābalaṃ;","thi-ap17:174.3":"Pūjayiṃsu ca niyyantiṃ, nibbutaṃ buddhamātaraṃ.","thi-ap17:175.1":"“Sabbāyo purato nītā, nibbutā sugatorasā;","thi-ap17:175.3":"Gotamī niyyate pacchā, sakkatā buddhaposikā.","thi-ap17:176.1":"“Purato devamanujā, sanāgāsurabrahmakā;","thi-ap17:176.3":"Pacchā sasāvako buddho, pūjatthaṃ yāti mātuyā.","thi-ap17:177.1":"“Buddhassa parinibbānaṃ, nedisaṃ āsi yādisaṃ;","thi-ap17:177.3":"Gotamīparinibbānaṃ, atevacchariyaṃ [atīvacchariyaṃ (sabbattha) mogallānabyākaraṇaṃ oloketabbaṃ] ahu.","thi-ap17:178.1":"“Buddho buddhassa nibbāne [na buddho buddhanibbāne (syā. pī.)], nopaṭiyādi [nopadissati (sī. pī.), sāriputtādi (syā.)] bhikkhavo;","thi-ap17:178.3":"Buddho gotaminibbāne, sāriputtādikā tathā [yathā (syā.)].","thi-ap17:179.1":"“Citakāni karitvāna, sabbagandhamayāni te;","thi-ap17:179.3":"Gandhacuṇṇapakiṇṇāni, jhāpayiṃsu ca tā tahiṃ.","thi-ap17:180.1":"“Sesabhāgāni ḍayhiṃsu, aṭṭhī sesāni sabbaso;","thi-ap17:180.3":"Ānando ca tadāvoca, saṃvegajanakaṃ vaco.","thi-ap17:181.1":"“‘Gotamī nidhanaṃ yātā, ḍayhañcassā sarīrakaṃ;","thi-ap17:181.3":"Saṅketaṃ buddhanibbānaṃ, na cirena bhavissati’.","thi-ap17:182.1":"“Tato gotamidhātūni, tassā pattagatāni so;","thi-ap17:182.3":"Upanāmesi nāthassa, ānando buddhacodito.","thi-ap17:183.1":"“Pāṇinā tāni paggayha, avoca isisattamo;","thi-ap17:183.3":"‘Mahato sāravantassa, yathā rukkhassa tiṭṭhato.","thi-ap17:184.1":"“‘Yo so mahattaro khandho, palujjeyya aniccatā;","thi-ap17:184.3":"Tathā bhikkhunisaṅghassa, gotamī parinibbutā.","thi-ap17:185.1":"“‘Aho acchariyaṃ mayhaṃ [ānanda passa buddhassa (syā.)], nibbutāyapi mātuyā;","thi-ap17:185.3":"Sarīramattasesāya, natthi sokapariddavo [na sokaparidevanā (syā.)].","thi-ap17:186.1":"“‘Na sociyā paresaṃ sā, tiṇṇasaṃsārasāgarā;","thi-ap17:186.3":"Parivajjitasantāpā, sītibhūtā sunibbutā.","thi-ap17:187.1":"“‘Paṇḍitāsi mahāpaññā, puthupaññā tatheva ca;","thi-ap17:187.3":"Rattaññū bhikkhunīnaṃ sā, evaṃ dhāretha bhikkhavo.","thi-ap17:188.1":"“‘Iddhīsu ca vasī āsi, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap17:188.3":"Cetopariyañāṇassa, vasī āsi ca gotamī.","thi-ap17:189.1":"“‘Pubbenivāsamaññāsi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap17:189.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi tassā punabbhavo.","thi-ap17:190.1":"“‘Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne tatheva ca;","thi-ap17:190.3":"Parisuddhaṃ ahu ñāṇaṃ, tasmā socaniyā na sā.","thi-ap17:191.1":"“‘Ayoghanahatasseva, jalato jātavedassa;","thi-ap17:191.3":"Anupubbūpasantassa, yathā na ñāyate gati.","thi-ap17:192.1":"“‘Evaṃ sammā vimuttānaṃ, kāmabandhoghatārinaṃ;","thi-ap17:192.3":"Paññāpetuṃ gati natthi, pattānaṃ acalaṃ sukhaṃ.","thi-ap17:193.1":"“‘Attadīpā tato hotha, satipaṭṭhānagocarā;","thi-ap17:193.3":"Bhāvetvā sattabojjhaṅge, dukkhassantaṃ karissatha’”.","thi-ap17:194.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ mahāpajāpatigotamī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap17:195.1":"Mahāpajāpatigotamītheriyāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
